<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Support | Submit a Ticket | WebRite</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><rect width='100' height='100' rx='25' fill='%232F5BFF'/><path d='M20 36 L35 70 L50 46 L65 70 L84 25' fill='none' stroke='white' stroke-width='9' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>">
<meta name="description" content="WebRite client support. Submit a ticket for website changes, fixes, new pages, hosting or billing questions and get a ticket number by email.">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --blue:#2F5BFF;
  --ink:#0B0B12;
  --bg:#EEF0F4;
  --white:#FFFFFF;
  --muted:#5A5F6E;
  --line:#D9DCE4;
  --urgent:#D93025;
}

* { box-sizing:border-box; }

html,body {
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  height:auto;
  overflow-x:hidden;
  font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.6;
}

.wrap {
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:35px 22px 90px;
}

h1,h2,h3,.brand { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; }

/* SITE MENU (same as homepage) */

.site-nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.site-nav .in{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:12px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.site-nav .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);font:700 22px "Space Grotesk",Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-1px}
.site-nav .logo b{color:var(--blue);font-weight:700}
.site-nav nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px 18px}
.site-nav nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font:600 14px Inter,sans-serif}
.site-nav nav a:hover,.site-nav nav a[aria-current="page"]{color:var(--blue)}
.site-nav nav a.nav-cta{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:50px}
.site-nav nav a.nav-cta:hover{background:#2146DC;color:#fff}
@media(max-width:560px){.site-nav .in{padding:10px 18px}.site-nav nav{gap:6px 14px}.site-nav nav a{font-size:13px}.site-nav nav a.nav-cta{padding:6px 12px}}

/* PAGE HEADER */

.page-head {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#142045,#0B0B12);
  color:white;
  padding:34px 32px;
  border-radius:24px;
  border:1px solid #29345E;
}

.eyebrow {
  color:#AFC3FF;
  font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:2px;
  font-weight:700;
}

.page-head h1 {
  font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,43px);
  line-height:1.12;
  letter-spacing:-1.5px;
  margin:10px 0 12px;
}

.page-head h1 span { color:#85A5FF; }

.page-head p {
  color:#D9E0F5;
  font-size:15px;
  max-width:640px;
  margin:0;
}

/* LAYOUT */

.support-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 320px;
  gap:22px;
  margin-top:24px;
  align-items:start;
}

.form-card {
  background:white;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:18px;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.form-card iframe {
  display:block;
  width:100%;
  height:1650px;
  border:0;
}

aside {
  display:grid;
  gap:16px;
  position:sticky;
  top:80px;
}

.box {
  background:white;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:18px;
  padding:22px;
}

.box h3 {
  font-size:18px;
  margin:0 0 10px;
}

.box p {
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:14px;
  margin:0;
}

.urgent {
  border:2px solid var(--urgent);
}

.urgent h3 { color:var(--urgent); }
.urgent p { color:var(--ink); }

.steps {
  list-style:none;
  counter-reset:s;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  display:grid;
  gap:13px;
}

.steps li {
  counter-increment:s;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;
  gap:10px;
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--muted);
}

.steps li::before {
  content:counter(s);
  width:28px;
  height:28px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--blue);
  color:#fff;
  font:700 13px "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
}

.steps strong { color:var(--ink); }

.tips {
  margin:0;
  padding-left:20px;
  color:#263557;
  font-size:14px;
}

.tips li { margin:5px 0; }

.fallback {
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:13px;
  margin:0;
}

.fallback a { color:var(--blue); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; }

/* FOOTER (same as homepage) */

.footer {
  margin-top:55px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  padding-top:28px;
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:30px;
}

.footer .brand {
  font-size:35px;
  font-weight:700;
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-3px;
}

.brand span { color:var(--blue); }

.tagline {
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:3px;
  color:var(--blue);
  margin-top:6px;
}

.footer h4 {
  color:var(--blue);
  margin:0 0 10px;
  font-size:14px;
}

.footer a,
.footer p {
  display:block;
  text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--ink);
  font-size:14px;
  margin:0 0 8px;
}

.footer a:hover,.footer a[aria-current="page"] { color:var(--blue); }

.footer-cols {
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:35px;
}

.copyright {
  width:100%;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:12px;
  margin-top:15px;
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media(max-width:900px) {
  .support-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  aside { position:static; order:-1; }
  .form-card iframe { height:2000px; }
}

@media(max-width:560px) {
  .wrap { padding:25px 18px 75px; }
  .page-head { padding:26px 20px; }
  .page-head h1 { font-size:31px; }
  .form-card iframe { height:2150px; }
  .footer-cols { gap:25px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="site-nav">
  <div class="in">
    <a class="logo" href="/">
      <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100" height="100" rx="25" fill="#2F5BFF"/><path d="M20 36 L35 70 L50 46 L65 70 L84 25" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      <span>Web<b>Rite</b></span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/meet-your-builder">Meet Your Builder</a>
      <a href="/faqs">FAQs</a>
      <a href="/support" aria-current="page">Support</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="/get-a-quote">Get a Quote</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">

  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">CLIENT SUPPORT</div>
    <h1>Submit a <span>Support Ticket</span></h1>
    <p>Need a change, a fix or something new on your website? Tell us what you need and you'll get a ticket number by email right away.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="support-grid">

    <div class="form-card">
      <iframe
        src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxcRuatkasClBlGLPufSMuG6bYTqNc0eNqLIEavexOAPBu8w/viewform?embedded=true"
        title="WebRite support ticket form" loading="lazy">Loading…</iframe>
    </div>

    <aside>
      <div class="box urgent">
        <h3>Is your site down?</h3>
        <p>Choose <strong>"Website is down"</strong> and <strong>Urgent</strong> on the form. Urgent tickets alert us right away and are handled first.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="box">
        <h3>What happens next</h3>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><span><strong>You get a ticket number</strong> by email within a minute, like WR-1001.</span></li>
          <li><span><strong>We review it</strong> and reach out the way you prefer if we have questions.</span></li>
          <li><span><strong>You get an email when it's done.</strong> Reply to it if anything isn't right.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="box">
        <h3>Tips for a faster fix</h3>
        <ul class="tips">
          <li>Name the page that needs changing</li>
          <li>Paste the exact new wording</li>
          <li>Share photos or logos as a Drive or Dropbox link</li>
          <li>One request per ticket</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="fallback">Form not loading? <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxcRuatkasClBlGLPufSMuG6bYTqNc0eNqLIEavexOAPBu8w/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open it in a new tab</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@webrite.net">support@webrite.net</a>.</p>
    </aside>

  </div>

  <footer class="footer">

    <div>
      <div class="brand">Web<span>Rite</span></div>
      <div class="tagline">WEBSITES THAT WORK</div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-cols">
      <div>
        <h4>Explore</h4>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/meet-your-builder">Meet Your Builder</a>
        <a href="/get-a-quote">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Help</h4>
        <a href="/faqs">FAQs</a>
        <a href="/support" aria-current="page">Support</a>
        <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Service Areas</h4>
        <p>Riverside</p>
        <p>Inland Empire</p>
        <p>Los Angeles</p>
        <p>Orange County</p>
        <p>San Diego</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="copyright">&copy; 2026 WebRite &middot; Websites That Work.</div>

  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
